    "text": "Vertices of the triangle formed by the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> are<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0,0</mn></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Area of the triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mfrac><msqrt><mi>D</mi></msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</m